formation\r\n[Sort monitored_bodies in area2d queries - #120966](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120966) finds and fixes #86640 by sorting overlap detection records before notifying callbacks of the overlaps. \r\n\r\nI think this is an important fix, but the merge sort does more work than necessary. It only needs to make sure that ENTERED signals are issued before EXIT signals. \r\n\r\nThis PR offers an alternative which uses the loop that is already there and issues the callbacks in two passes, one for ENTERED, and the next pass for EXIT. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12552379261,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAC7C4bfQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.8","name":"cherrypick:4.8","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.8.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":16503691,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A-9OL","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/26","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/26","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/26/labels","number":26,"state":"open","title":"4.9","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatar